"https://wahapedia.ru/wh40k11ed/the-rules/core-rules/#3.-Save-Rolls">save r=
olls</a></b></b> to be worse then 6 should I make those <b>save rolls</b>?<=
/i></td></tr><tr><td align=3D"center" class=3D"faq_A">A:</td><td><div style=
=3D"margin-top:1px">Yes, because other models in your unit may have <b>Sv</=
b>=E2=80=99s that are better those models you=E2=80=99ve mentioned, this me=
ans that enough <b>save rolls</b> could be allocated to the those models th=
at the rest of the results are not greater then the <b>Sv</b>=E2=80=99s of =
the other models in your unit.</div></td></tr></tbody></table></div>
