ocked</a></b></b>.</li><li>If that roll fails, that unit, and each model in=
 it, is <b>battle-shocked</b>.</li></ul><br>While a unit is <b>battle-shock=
ed</b>:<br><ul><li>The Objective Control (<b>OC</b>) characteristic of all =
of its models is modified to =E2=80=98-=E2=80=99 (<span class=3D"kwn"><a hr=
